title: "TlachIA Metrics: Unified Scientometric Indicators Calculation Engine for OpenAlex"
abstract: "Scientometric intelligence platform and analytical engine designed to construct customized OpenAlex corpuses and compute a comprehensive suite of indicators covering scientific production, citation impact (FWCI, citation percentiles), Diamond Open Access, APC economics, collaboration networks, and knowledge taxonomies."
